2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span> </b><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Railway Assistant Loco Pilot (ALP) Recruitment 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>RRB Advt No. : CEN 01/2026: &nbsp;Short Details of Notification</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"361\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b>15/05/2026*</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>14/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>16/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction / Modified Form : <b>17-26 June 2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date : <b>As per Schedule &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>Notified Soon&nbsp; </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"392\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General UR / OBC / EWS : <b>500/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH <b>: 250/-</b></li>\n<li>All Category Female <b>: 250/-</b></li>\n<li><b>After Appear the Stage I Exam </b></li>\n<li>UR/OBC/EWS Fee Refund : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH / Female Refund <b>: 250/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Railway Assistant Loco Pilot Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/07/2026</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>30 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Railway Recruitment Board RRB ALP Recruitment Advt No. CEN 01/2026 Vacancy Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>RRB ALP Recruitment 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b> Vacancy Details Total : 11127 Post</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"170\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"460\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Railway RRB ALP Eligibility 2026</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"170\">\n<p align=\"center\">Railway Assistant Loco Pilot ALP CEN 01/2026</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\n<p align=\"center\">11127</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"460\">\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th Matric with ITI from NCVT / SCVT Certificate in Fitter, Electrician, Instrument Mechanic, Millwright, Maintenance Mechanic, Mechanic Radio and TV, Electronics Mechanic, Mechanic Motor Vehicle, Wireman, Tractor Mechanic, Armature and Coil Winder, mechanic Diesel, Heat Engine, Turner, Machinist, Refrigeration and AC <b>OR</b></li>\n<li>Class 10th with Diploma in Mechanical / Electrical / Electronics / Automobile Engineering <b>OR</b></li>\n<li>BE / B.Tech Degree in Mechanical / Electrical / Electronics / Automobile Engineering</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Railway RRB ALP 2026 Zone Wise Vacancy Details:&nbsp; </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Category Wise Vacancy Details Available Soon</b></span></span><b> </b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Fill Railway RRB ALP Assistant Loco Pilot Online Form 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Railway Recruitment Board RRB Online Released Assistant Loco Pilot ALP Recruitment Advt No. CEN 01/2026 Exam. Candidate Can Apply Between <b>15/05/2026 to 14/06/2026.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Railway Board ALP Exam 2026 Advt No. 01/2026 Exam Online Form 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Entrance Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full RRB CEN 01/2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"337\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"416\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"403\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"Apply Online RRB ALP CEN 01/2024 Registration\" href=\"https://www.rrbapply.gov.in/#/auth/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Fill Form (Video Hindi)</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"403\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"Apply On